    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwenu chamweniyi mwana kaAmozi Isaya chansaŋu yaYudana Yerusalema mumafuku adiŋi anyanta awaYuda Uziya naYotami, naAhazi naHezekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mawulu tiyenu, eyi iseki tiyililaku, muloŋa Yehova nahoshi, nindi, Nadiishi anyana, nayileli, wena anadikaŋa nanami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋombi welukaŋa wámuheta, nichimbulu welukaŋa akwitaŋi dankaka yindi. AIsarela hiyelukaku, antu ami hiyakweti kashinshuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyayi! O muza wanshidi, antu aditwika kuluwa, anyana kawakwakukoŋa chatama, anyana akwakutokesha akwawu; analeki dehi Yehova, anadiwuli Wajila waIsarela, ela dehi enyi, anafunti hanyima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋanyi chayetaŋawu ho-o nihanu, enu nawa saŋa mwadikaŋala? Mutu wejima wakata, muchima wejima wazeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kumadachilu ndo nikunamutu nihakola hosi; kwayitu namabinjila nayilonda yamashina hohu, hakadi kujika, hela kukasa, hela kwovwahisha namanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa denu dela dehi kwamahembi hohu; nyikala yenu ayocha dehi nakesi; ituŋa denuadidya dehi kudi antu acheŋa, iku enu aweni mutalaŋa namesu, dela dehi kwamahembi hohu, neyi dakwimika dehi mushindu kudi antu acheŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyuli amuSodoma, tiyenu izu daYehova; enu antu amuGomora teŋelekenu matu mutiyi nshimbi jaNzambi yetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Indiiyi yimuna yayivulu yimudi nakunketwila yanka? Ami nckuti dehi nyilambu yakushita yayizamba yanyikoku, nimanji ayimuna yakudiisha; hinatiyi kwami kuwaha namashi amayoŋa aŋombi amayala hela anyana kanyikoku hela ayizamba yampembuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwenzaŋa nakumwekana kumesu ami, hinyi wayilejeli nindi mwakadatolaŋa muyipaŋu yami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi muleta cheŋanawa nyilambu yakuhemeshaku; insensi nayimoni dehi hichishimashima hohu, nikakweji kakaha, nisabata, nikutambika yipompelu, yadi. Hikuluwa tuhu, hela kukumaŋa ana kwakudihudika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitukweji twenu twatwiha niyawija yenu yakudishiika, muchima wami kuyikeŋa nehi, yankabishaŋa tuhu; nazeyi dehi nakukabakana nayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimukuŋa olwela makasenu nukuyibutila mesu ami. Mwalala, hela mukuvulisha kulomba hinukutiyaku; makasenu anenzali mbe namashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welenu, ditookeshenu; fumishenukumesu ami kutama kwyuma yimwelaŋa; lekenu kwila chatama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Inzenu tutiyapanenu, hela neyi nshidi jenu jichinana, jakatooka to-o neyi mpeza; hela neyi jichinana nge, jakatooka neyi wanda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukala wakashinshi o chiwunabalumuki dehi neyi chivumbi! Wadipiwenzala wupaji! Mwashakaminaŋa kuŋa, ichi himudi ambanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silivayeyi yinabalumuki dehi mazozu, wahva weyi awubomba dehi nameji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulamba tweyi twadikapa, adikata nawamakombi; wejima wawu akeŋamaseleka, alondaŋa mawufwetu; hiyasompelapa anshonaku, kudi wenahikwashikapa nsaŋu yawantuluwaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova wamazaza, Mukwaŋovu wawaIsarela, nindi, Eyo-o, akwankunyi nami nukudifumishawu, niayilumbu jami nukuditendawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukukufuntishila cheŋi chikasa chami, nukukuzakasa muluteŋunikufumishi mazozu eyi, nikufumishi wufoyu weyi wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakufuntishila ansompeshi jeyi neyi hatachi, niakwakukuleja maana, neyihakusambila. Nkumininaku akakutena nawu, Mukala wakuloŋa, nawu, Mukala wakashinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziyona akamukúula nakusompesha, antu indiakafunta akayikuula nakuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kwakumotoka nshimbi niakwanshidi akakotokela hamu, antu alekapa Yehova akayinoŋesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mwakatiya nsonyi janyikula yimwakeŋa eli, mwakanoŋa ajala kumesu namatempenu mwatondeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mwakekala neyi mukula walepukapamafu, neyi itempa dakadi meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwaŋovu wakekala neyi nfufu, mudimu windi wakekala neyi lusasi, yejima yiyedi yakakwatila kesi hamu, hosi wakakajimaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
